Not all tarnished weapons are created equal. The following table shows which have the best ratios. Since these weapons lack stats, use the highest ratio you can find/blacksmith. Something else to think about, is the [[Mechanics#Melee_damage | Damage cap]]. Between levels 1-9, the maximum base damage a weapon can have is 10. Therefore, the Tarnished halberd is capped at 10 damage with 55 delay, giving it a damage to delay of 0.182. This is less than both the [[Tarnished Two Handed Battle Axe]] and [[Tarnished Two Handed Sword]].

